Package: py-autoclicker
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: l4nrete
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-evdev, python3-pydantic, python3-dasbus, python3-gi, gir1.2-adw-1, udev, kmod
Description: Native Wayland Autoclicker for Ubuntu / GNOME
 Low-level evdev/uinput auto-clicker built for GNOME / Mutter on Wayland.
 Features a native GTK4/Libadwaita UI, Gaussian temporal jitter, spatial
 micro-drift, automatic user override, and zero-relogin uaccess permissions.

